Provenance of the R code
------------------------

The R code in RscDRS re-implements the algorithms of the Python scDRS
listed above; the code comments and help pages name the Python
functions that each part ports. No Python code is included in the
package. The package was developed with the assistance of an AI coding assistant (Assisted-by: Claude,
Anthropic); all code was reviewed by the maintainer, who is responsible
for it, and is tested against the output of the Python scDRS
(tests/testthat/, inst/scripts/python/). All code in RscDRS is
distributed under the MIT License (see LICENSE and LICENSE.md).
